  #line-at(85.104pt, 316.97pt, "spatial positions to form a frequency-resolved lattice. A lens (f=250 mm) focuses the ")
  #line-at(85.104pt, 337.73pt, "dispersed comb onto the DMD (10 kHz switching rate), which digitally encodes the ")
  #line-at(85.104pt, 358.37pt, "selected frequency components. To characterize the encoder, we capture the coded comb ")
